    </dependencies>
  </context>

  <constraints>
    <constraint source="DS-4 §6 H13 placeholder deep-dive">This probe replaces a Placeholder verifier that currently returns InfraFault UNCONDITIONALLY for every subject -- the fix is a REAL check, not a different flavor of always-pass. KV secret presence check (SecretClient) + a live Graph containerType GET under ClientCertificateCredential -- proving confidential-client auth is genuinely in effect, reusing task 131's cert-credential construction pattern.</constraint>
    <constraint source="DS-4 §6 pipelining note">H13 probes are buildable pipelined alongside their subject handler's wave, not serialized to the end -- this task can be authored as soon as its subject handler (cited in &lt;deps&gt;) lands, even though it is NUMBERED in the G-7 acceptance range for readability.</constraint>
    <constraint source="DS-4 §6 T6 row">The 24h SPE replication gate is a legitimate WaitingOnGate outcome for this probe, not a Fail -- do not treat a pending-replication response as a probe failure.</constraint>
  </constraints>

  <knowledge>
