  <notes>Justification (CLAUDE.md §11): Existing -- the IE2ETrapVerifier/IE2EInvariantVerifier interface + E2EAcceptanceModule registration pattern already exist; only this ONE id's implementation is a placeholder. Extension -- replacing one Placeholder registration with a real one, following the SAME interface contract, is the exact minimal move. Cost-of-doing-nothing -- H13's acceptance gate cannot go green as coded (DS-4's own words) without this probe; the acceptance-target transition (task 184/185/186) is blocked on EVERY probe individually landing.</notes>

